(5905118, 860810, 51793, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, I wish I had a tree like that. I could use that as a background for a senior shoot or something like that. If we ever get a challenge where you can photograph someones face you should do it near this tree and get that green moss to fill the background.</td>', 'Oh wow, I wish I had a tree like that. I could use that as a background for a senior shoot or something like that. If we ever get a challenge where you can photograph someones face you should do it near this tree and get that green moss to fill the background.', '2010-03-15 08:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
