(5905123, 860802, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo but I don''t like the border. I think it takes away from the image. I''m not sure where this would place but I think in this picture if you would have given it a larger black border on the top and bottom followed by a thin black border on the left and right it would have REALLY brought this image to life. This would have been a strong 9 for me but I''m giving this a 7 because I really dislike the border.</td>', 'This is a great photo but I don''t like the border. I think it takes away from the image. I''m not sure where this would place but I think in this picture if you would have given it a larger black border on the top and bottom followed by a thin black border on the left and right it would have REALLY brought this image to life. This would have been a strong 9 for me but I''m giving this a 7 because I really dislike the border.', '2010-03-15 08:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
