(5905234, 860792, 82999, '<td valign="top">I love water drop shots, but you see them all the time.  I do like how you''ve pared the theme with a drop shot.  That said, seems a little soft to me.</td>', 'I love water drop shots, but you see them all the time.  I do like how you''ve pared the theme with a drop shot.  That said, seems a little soft to me.', '2010-03-15 09:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
