(5905247, 860562, 82999, '<td valign="top">Seems to be much more about the bird than the branch.  And I don''t see enough of branch to feel as if it''s really an element of the scene.  The out of focus bird int he background is a distraction to my eye as well.</td>', 'Seems to be much more about the bird than the branch.  And I don''t see enough of branch to feel as if it''s really an element of the scene.  The out of focus bird int he background is a distraction to my eye as well.', '2010-03-15 10:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905248, 860264, 82999, '<td valign="top">Interesting play on the theme.</td>', 'Interesting play on the theme.', '2010-03-15 10:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
