(5905874, 860534, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition using the camera rotation to frame the shot. The harsher sunlight serves to shade the texture of the branch somewhat but it really highlighted the ripples in the water well. There seems to be an overall blue cast to the image.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition using the camera rotation to frame the shot. The harsher sunlight serves to shade the texture of the branch somewhat but it really highlighted the ripples in the water well. There seems to be an overall blue cast to the image.', '2010-03-15 19:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905878, 860794, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very cool and even lighting. Great DoF to isolate the subject.</td>', 'Very cool and even lighting. Great DoF to isolate the subject.', '2010-03-15 19:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905886, 859739, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very cute find. The use of three turtles is good and you got a good reflection. However the focus is really missed and I see no artistic reason why it would be done purposfully.</td>', 'Very cute find. The use of three turtles is good and you got a good reflection. However the focus is really missed and I see no artistic reason why it would be done purposfully.', '2010-03-15 19:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905888, 859810, 10785, '<td valign="top">The big clunky frame is really overpowering the photo.</td>', 'The big clunky frame is really overpowering the photo.', '2010-03-15 19:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905893, 860564, 10785, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and serene scene. I do think it needs a little something extra in the scene to turn it from a static background image into something dynamic for that higher score.</td>', 'Beautiful and serene scene. I do think it needs a little something extra in the scene to turn it from a static background image into something dynamic for that higher score.', '2010-03-15 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905895, 860489, 10785, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a movie called "The Gods Must Be Crazy". He would have to have a bottle of Coke with him though. But the picture is vibrant and colorful. The tree is cool and I am glad you put a person in the image to give it something more!</td>', 'Reminds me of a movie called "The Gods Must Be Crazy". He would have to have a bottle of Coke with him though. But the picture is vibrant and colorful. The tree is cool and I am glad you put a person in the image to give it something more!', '2010-03-15 19:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905904, 860208, 10785, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo! There is only one critique I could give and that is to lose the extra space on the left of the tree. I know it fits that High Definition crop ratio but I don''t see it serving a purpose. There would be greater definition and texture showing on the tree if it were closer and filled in the frame a bit more.</td>', 'Outstanding photo! There is only one critique I could give and that is to lose the extra space on the left of the tree. I know it fits that High Definition crop ratio but I don''t see it serving a purpose. There would be greater definition and texture showing on the tree if it were closer and filled in the frame a bit more.', '2010-03-15 19:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905905, 860810, 10785, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scene!</td>', 'A beautiful scene!', '2010-03-15 19:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905908, 859990, 10785, '<td valign="top">Homage?? I think you did him one better!!</td>', 'Homage?? I think you did him one better!!', '2010-03-15 20:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905996, 860489, 70503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I love the color.</td>', 'Beautiful image. I love the color.', '2010-03-15 21:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5905998, 860820, 70503, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint. Not sure I like the crop.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint. Not sure I like the crop.', '2010-03-15 21:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906000, 860689, 57447, '<td valign="top">Compelling.</td>', 'Compelling.', '2010-03-15 21:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906004, 860467, 70503, '<td valign="top">This almost reminds me of a film shot done in the 70''s. I like the feel of the photo, but something bothers me too. I can''t quite put my finger on it though. I will revisit this one later.</td>', 'This almost reminds me of a film shot done in the 70''s. I like the feel of the photo, but something bothers me too. I can''t quite put my finger on it though. I will revisit this one later.', '2010-03-15 21:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906005, 860786, 70503, '<td valign="top">Although this is a fantastic image, I feel that the bird is more of the subject than the branch.</td>', 'Although this is a fantastic image, I feel that the bird is more of the subject than the branch.', '2010-03-15 21:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906006, 860208, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the tree to the left, it just pulls you in.</td>', 'I like the placement of the tree to the left, it just pulls you in.', '2010-03-15 21:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906007, 860454, 70503, '<td valign="top">Love the PP on this image. It feels a little Tim Burton-ish. I really like it. Great job!</td>', 'Love the PP on this image. It feels a little Tim Burton-ish. I really like it. Great job!', '2010-03-15 21:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906009, 860789, 70503, '<td valign="top">I love the snow on branches. Taken many shots just like this. Oh and is it Spring Snow or Sping Snow? LOL</td>', 'I love the snow on branches. Taken many shots just like this. Oh and is it Spring Snow or Sping Snow? LOL', '2010-03-15 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906010, 859806, 70503, '<td valign="top">Very pretty sky peeking through those branches. I love it!</td>', 'Very pretty sky peeking through those branches. I love it!', '2010-03-15 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906011, 860469, 57447, '<td valign="top">Hope to see this with a ribbon.  Preferably blue.</td>', 'Hope to see this with a ribbon.  Preferably blue.', '2010-03-15 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5906014, 860742, 70503, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I like most everything about the image except the blue and white rainbow effect in the middle.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I like most everything about the image except the blue and white rainbow effect in the middle.', '2010-03-15 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906015, 860379, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like this, the tone &amp; oof background.</td>', 'I like this, the tone & oof background.', '2010-03-15 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906017, 860653, 70503, '<td valign="top">ooooh PURTY!! I like this one a lot!</td>', 'ooooh PURTY!! I like this one a lot!', '2010-03-15 21:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906019, 860564, 70503, '<td valign="top">Pretty! I like the misty feeling of this... great capture.</td>', 'Pretty! I like the misty feeling of this... great capture.', '2010-03-15 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906021, 860802, 70503, '<td valign="top">Love the title...it fits so perfectly. One suggestion would be to crop out the road signs on the left.</td>', 'Love the title...it fits so perfectly. One suggestion would be to crop out the road signs on the left.', '2010-03-15 21:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906025, 859990, 70503, '<td valign="top">Cool! I think the branch is not prominent enough for this challenge, but I LOVE the image!</td>', 'Cool! I think the branch is not prominent enough for this challenge, but I LOVE the image!', '2010-03-15 21:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906027, 860713, 70503, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. I like this shot a lot!</td>', 'Great DOF. I like this shot a lot!', '2010-03-15 21:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906030, 860256, 70503, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I guess I don''t see how it relates to the challenge... I only know because of the title.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I guess I don''t see how it relates to the challenge... I only know because of the title.', '2010-03-15 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906032, 860635, 70503, '<td valign="top">I feel that the light in the center detracts from the branches. Definitely interesting.</td>', 'I feel that the light in the center detracts from the branches. Definitely interesting.', '2010-03-15 21:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906033, 860817, 70503, '<td valign="top">WOW that is white! I like the contrast and the branch is interesting.</td>', 'WOW that is white! I like the contrast and the branch is interesting.', '2010-03-15 21:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906037, 860324, 70503, '<td valign="top">Fire... bushes... and a Skunk... oh My! I think there is a bit too much going on in this one. Interesting for sure.</td>', 'Fire... bushes... and a Skunk... oh My! I think there is a bit too much going on in this one. Interesting for sure.', '2010-03-15 21:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906039, 860715, 70503, '<td valign="top">Cool branch. I think it would be better if you cloned out the yellow line in the back, it is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cool branch. I think it would be better if you cloned out the yellow line in the back, it is a bit distracting.', '2010-03-15 21:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906042, 860679, 70503, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Great DOF. Love the water drops. Great job!</td>', 'Nice shot! Great DOF. Love the water drops. Great job!', '2010-03-15 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906044, 860604, 70503, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I love the perspective and the lighting. Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool. I love the perspective and the lighting. Nicely done!', '2010-03-15 21:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906045, 860651, 70503, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W. I want to be there reading a book.</td>', 'Nice B&W. I want to be there reading a book.', '2010-03-15 21:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906046, 860799, 70503, '<td valign="top">I love the flow of the branches. Very interesting capture.</td>', 'I love the flow of the branches. Very interesting capture.', '2010-03-15 21:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906047, 860792, 70503, '<td valign="top">Nice! One of my favorites.</td>', 'Nice! One of my favorites.', '2010-03-15 21:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906050, 860749, 70503, '<td valign="top">I love the "odd man out" on the right side. It stands out from the crowd and is a pleasing difference. Great Job!</td>', 'I love the "odd man out" on the right side. It stands out from the crowd and is a pleasing difference. Great Job!', '2010-03-15 21:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906053, 860643, 70503, '<td valign="top">Wow that is cool. Great shot.</td>', 'Wow that is cool. Great shot.', '2010-03-15 21:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906054, 860462, 70503, '<td valign="top">I love this. Are you laying down? So cool!</td>', 'I love this. Are you laying down? So cool!', '2010-03-15 21:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906088, 860749, 75618, '<td valign="top">I think the soft focus/processing is a little overdone but interesting picture. 7</td>', 'I think the soft focus/processing is a little overdone but interesting picture. 7', '2010-03-15 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906095, 860379, 75618, '<td valign="top">First buds of spring always amaze me!  I like the bokeh and the dof. Not a big fan of the vignetting, I wish it was more feathered. Overall, a very beautiful image. 8</td>', 'First buds of spring always amaze me!  I like the bokeh and the dof. Not a big fan of the vignetting, I wish it was more feathered. Overall, a very beautiful image. 8', '2010-03-15 21:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906143, 859990, 44025, '<td valign="top">nice composition! 8</td>', 'nice composition! 8', '2010-03-15 22:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906191, 860816, 81362, '<td valign="top">One of the best, extra points for orignality and purity of main subject form. Unfortunately, this goes against the usual DPC grain, but a subculture will enjoy it. I might have cropped the top just enough to minimize the black but retain the irregular artsy feel. Texture is interesting (paper towel?). 9</td>', 'One of the best, extra points for orignality and purity of main subject form. Unfortunately, this goes against the usual DPC grain, but a subculture will enjoy it. I might have cropped the top just enough to minimize the black but retain the irregular artsy feel. Texture is interesting (paper towel?). 9', '2010-03-15 22:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5906196, 860528, 94437, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t like these high key images, but I like the way this becomes more pleasing the more you look to the right</td>', 'I generally don''t like these high key images, but I like the way this becomes more pleasing the more you look to the right', '2010-03-15 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
