(5906317, 860749, 61396, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary lighting and processing except maybe the sky which seem a bit off (but it is still fun to watch).</td>', 'Extraordinary lighting and processing except maybe the sky which seem a bit off (but it is still fun to watch).', '2010-03-16 03:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
