(5910722, 860469, 94437, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this picture, it does feel very unworldly</td>', 'Great lighting on this picture, it does feel very unworldly', '2010-03-19 20:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910723, 860804, 94437, '<td valign="top">Great simple picture, I hope its "outside the box" just enough to score well.</td>', 'Great simple picture, I hope its "outside the box" just enough to score well.', '2010-03-19 20:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910733, 860445, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a different interpretation of branch... A good photo with a very rich blue sky. I like how you have captured the shadows.</td>', 'This is a different interpretation of branch... A good photo with a very rich blue sky. I like how you have captured the shadows.', '2010-03-19 20:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910735, 860493, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot is excellent at the bottom but fades at the top. It is very sharp and in focus on the trunk of this behemoth but at the top the sharpness and the focus fades and there is some wicked chromatic abberation too. The curving branches lead your eye up to the top of the photo where there is nothing there to focus on.</td>', 'This shot is excellent at the bottom but fades at the top. It is very sharp and in focus on the trunk of this behemoth but at the top the sharpness and the focus fades and there is some wicked chromatic abberation too. The curving branches lead your eye up to the top of the photo where there is nothing there to focus on.', '2010-03-19 20:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910736, 860276, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is somewhat grey overall and lacking in color. There are some good shapes that do help it out.</td>', 'This is somewhat grey overall and lacking in color. There are some good shapes that do help it out.', '2010-03-19 20:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910739, 860282, 10785, '<td valign="top">I get the reference to branch as being a remote office. I think the picture is good except the computer is blown out with highlights on the case and you can''t see the screen too well. It seems as if you tried to highlight the landscape in the background rather than the computer, which is the subject, in the foreground.</td>', 'I get the reference to branch as being a remote office. I think the picture is good except the computer is blown out with highlights on the case and you can''t see the screen too well. It seems as if you tried to highlight the landscape in the background rather than the computer, which is the subject, in the foreground.', '2010-03-19 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910741, 860320, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is a little weak here. If you look at it as just lines, there is a big thick line across the bottom with a few small lines pointing upward. The big thick line is weighing everything down. Perhaps rotating it vertically would help add some strength to it.</td>', 'I think the composition is a little weak here. If you look at it as just lines, there is a big thick line across the bottom with a few small lines pointing upward. The big thick line is weighing everything down. Perhaps rotating it vertically would help add some strength to it.', '2010-03-19 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910743, 860492, 10785, '<td valign="top">The use of shadows is the strongest aspect of this shot. I wold like to see some shape to the pipe alignment or the use of symmetry somehow to make this stronger.</td>', 'The use of shadows is the strongest aspect of this shot. I wold like to see some shape to the pipe alignment or the use of symmetry somehow to make this stronger.', '2010-03-19 21:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910744, 860635, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light and shadow here.</td>', 'I like the use of light and shadow here.', '2010-03-19 21:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910746, 859875, 10785, '<td valign="top">The rainbow is strong, but the branch is the weakest element in the photo.</td>', 'The rainbow is strong, but the branch is the weakest element in the photo.', '2010-03-19 21:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910748, 860209, 10785, '<td valign="top">Superb family photo. It should be a treasure for the generations to enjoy!</td>', 'Superb family photo. It should be a treasure for the generations to enjoy!', '2010-03-19 21:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910750, 860603, 10785, '<td valign="top">What makes this so good? I think it is the light and shadow at play on the branches and the royal blue color of the sky in contrast with the grey/brown color of the branches. The textures also stand out well. There seems to be some noise in the sky, or perhaps added grain of some sort which keeps me from voting higher than I did.</td>', 'What makes this so good? I think it is the light and shadow at play on the branches and the royal blue color of the sky in contrast with the grey/brown color of the branches. The textures also stand out well. There seems to be some noise in the sky, or perhaps added grain of some sort which keeps me from voting higher than I did.', '2010-03-19 21:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910779, 860690, 57447, '<td valign="top">Compelling.</td>', 'Compelling.', '2010-03-19 22:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910781, 860529, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great processing.</td>', 'Great processing.', '2010-03-19 22:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910782, 860664, 57447, '<td valign="top">6, looked at again, now 7.</td>', '6, looked at again, now 7.', '2010-03-19 22:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910783, 860540, 57447, '<td valign="top">That is one large tree, nice B&amp;W process.</td>', 'That is one large tree, nice B&W process.', '2010-03-19 22:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910794, 860264, 100928, '<td valign="top">Neat!</td>', 'Neat!', '2010-03-19 22:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910795, 860175, 100928, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2010-03-19 22:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910862, 859826, 94437, '<td valign="top">Great colors, love the shadows in the bg too.</td>', 'Great colors, love the shadows in the bg too.', '2010-03-20 02:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910863, 860711, 94437, '<td valign="top">Its not quite a branch, but I dont care its a really nice image</td>', 'Its not quite a branch, but I dont care its a really nice image', '2010-03-20 02:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910864, 860783, 94437, '<td valign="top">I cant see a tree branch so I''m thinking maybe this is called a branch of something else......<br/>Anyway I think its too far out side the box to score well.<br/>Sorry</td>', 'I cant see a tree branch so I''m thinking maybe this is called a branch of something else......Anyway I think its too far out side the box to score well.Sorry', '2010-03-20 02:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910865, 859380, 94437, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to squeeze this into the branch challenge ?</td>', 'I''m not sure how to squeeze this into the branch challenge ?', '2010-03-20 02:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910866, 860282, 94437, '<td valign="top">OK so you made me think you work from home, I wish I could. But unfortunately its not all that interesting to look at</td>', 'OK so you made me think you work from home, I wish I could. But unfortunately its not all that interesting to look at', '2010-03-20 02:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910867, 860276, 94437, '<td valign="top">I can see that you have made this more interesting by rotating the image which does help but overall the colors are a bit flat.</td>', 'I can see that you have made this more interesting by rotating the image which does help but overall the colors are a bit flat.', '2010-03-20 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910868, 860387, 94437, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge but the focus killed this shot</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge but the focus killed this shot', '2010-03-20 02:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910869, 860115, 94437, '<td valign="top">Plenty of wood and branches, but the focus is a bit soft and its not all  that interesting<br/>Sorry</td>', 'Plenty of wood and branches, but the focus is a bit soft and its not all  that interestingSorry', '2010-03-20 02:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910870, 860789, 94437, '<td valign="top">I''m liking the depth of the snow and the sharp edge it leaves on the branch</td>', 'I''m liking the depth of the snow and the sharp edge it leaves on the branch', '2010-03-20 02:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910871, 860492, 94437, '<td valign="top">I can see the branch connection, but i recon it must be hard to "pretty up" a photo like this.<br/>I hope you score well.</td>', 'I can see the branch connection, but i recon it must be hard to "pretty up" a photo like this.I hope you score well.', '2010-03-20 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910872, 860634, 94437, '<td valign="top">A bird that big needs big branches to make a nest I recon....<br/>Nice image.</td>', 'A bird that big needs big branches to make a nest I recon....Nice image.', '2010-03-20 02:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910873, 860615, 94437, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I might like it slightly more if you cropped out a bit more of the shoulder.<br/>But the colors in the bg add to the image as do the flowers in teh hair.</td>', 'Nice photo, I might like it slightly more if you cropped out a bit more of the shoulder.But the colors in the bg add to the image as do the flowers in teh hair.', '2010-03-20 02:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910906, 860651, 104841, '<td valign="top">look great shot, and good mono conversion. I am only going to give it a 6 though as I don''t really see the challenge topic being the focus of your shot.</td>', 'look great shot, and good mono conversion. I am only going to give it a 6 though as I don''t really see the challenge topic being the focus of your shot.', '2010-03-20 05:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910907, 860209, 104841, '<td valign="top">really nice family shot but I don''t think that it should be in this challenge. Normally I will give this an 8 but because of the challenge only a 6.</td>', 'really nice family shot but I don''t think that it should be in this challenge. Normally I will give this an 8 but because of the challenge only a 6.', '2010-03-20 05:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910910, 860564, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice misty shot, I would have adjusted the white balance though.</td>', 'nice misty shot, I would have adjusted the white balance though.', '2010-03-20 05:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910930, 860525, 95579, '<td valign="top">Square crop works nicely here. the background branches are just perfect to enhance the pinkness but without distracting from the main subject</td>', 'Square crop works nicely here. the background branches are just perfect to enhance the pinkness but without distracting from the main subject', '2010-03-20 07:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910977, 860208, 70270, '<td valign="top">one of my faves from the challenge; like the comp and processing, and the vignette adds a nice touch as well.</td>', 'one of my faves from the challenge; like the comp and processing, and the vignette adds a nice touch as well.', '2010-03-20 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910979, 860626, 70270, '<td valign="top">haunting light, love the shallow DOF here.</td>', 'haunting light, love the shallow DOF here.', '2010-03-20 10:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910980, 860288, 70270, '<td valign="top">Grain works, so does B+W.  nice job</td>', 'Grain works, so does B+W.  nice job', '2010-03-20 10:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910981, 860796, 70270, '<td valign="top">Classic comp, nice tones.  Well done.</td>', 'Classic comp, nice tones.  Well done.', '2010-03-20 10:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910982, 860644, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF; the spikes on the branch add a lot of interest to the image as well.</td>', 'Good use of DOF; the spikes on the branch add a lot of interest to the image as well.', '2010-03-20 10:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910983, 860749, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice version of a classic shot.  And the bamboo to me is a branch ... just that the main trunk is underground.  :)</td>', 'Nice version of a classic shot.  And the bamboo to me is a branch ... just that the main trunk is underground.  :)', '2010-03-20 10:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910984, 859994, 70270, '<td valign="top">Strong contrast works; highlights look a little blown but overall a well done image</td>', 'Strong contrast works; highlights look a little blown but overall a well done image', '2010-03-20 10:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910986, 859429, 70270, '<td valign="top">very sharp, good closeup.  I like the shallow DOF, but the background here is just a bit too distracting and competes with the main branch.  Still a 7 from me, tho.</td>', 'very sharp, good closeup.  I like the shallow DOF, but the background here is just a bit too distracting and competes with the main branch.  Still a 7 from me, tho.', '2010-03-20 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910987, 860481, 70270, '<td valign="top">looks like dried cherries!  nice shot.</td>', 'looks like dried cherries!  nice shot.', '2010-03-20 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910988, 860816, 70270, '<td valign="top">good eye, well seen and i like the high contrast.  At first I didn''t like the  background edges, but after masking them off on the screen I do like it better the way you''ve done it.</td>', 'good eye, well seen and i like the high contrast.  At first I didn''t like the  background edges, but after masking them off on the screen I do like it better the way you''ve done it.', '2010-03-20 10:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910992, 860652, 70270, '<td valign="top">I love the comp and the shallow DOF with a recognizable background.  My only nit is the harsh shadows on the pomegranate.</td>', 'I love the comp and the shallow DOF with a recognizable background.  My only nit is the harsh shadows on the pomegranate.', '2010-03-20 10:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910993, 860379, 70270, '<td valign="top">well done image; reminds me of something I''d see on a sympathy card.  well done.</td>', 'well done image; reminds me of something I''d see on a sympathy card.  well done.', '2010-03-20 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910994, 860702, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice change of pace for this challenge.  Good comp and processing, but would like to see one more element in the frame to really make it pop .... an interesting character (big daddy) walking along the tracks in the distance would be perfect</td>', 'Nice change of pace for this challenge.  Good comp and processing, but would like to see one more element in the frame to really make it pop .... an interesting character (big daddy) walking along the tracks in the distance would be perfect', '2010-03-20 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910995, 860345, 70270, '<td valign="top">not liking the processing ... just a bit too harsh for my taste.</td>', 'not liking the processing ... just a bit too harsh for my taste.', '2010-03-20 10:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910996, 860698, 70270, '<td valign="top">white balance kills this for me, as does the foreground distractions in the lower left of the frame.</td>', 'white balance kills this for me, as does the foreground distractions in the lower left of the frame.', '2010-03-20 10:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910997, 860467, 70270, '<td valign="top">bumping this up on another look, because i like that old polaroid feel it gives off.</td>', 'bumping this up on another look, because i like that old polaroid feel it gives off.', '2010-03-20 10:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5910998, 860115, 70270, '<td valign="top">its a branch, but there''s not much here that makes this an interesting photograph.</td>', 'its a branch, but there''s not much here that makes this an interesting photograph.', '2010-03-20 10:29:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5911001, 860387, 70270, '<td valign="top">not liking the downward angle of the shot or the lighting and shadows on the hand.  The leaves in the background running through the hand hurt this as well.  Comes off as a casual snapshot without much thought behind it.</td>', 'not liking the downward angle of the shot or the lighting and shadows on the hand.  The leaves in the background running through the hand hurt this as well.  Comes off as a casual snapshot without much thought behind it.', '2010-03-20 10:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911003, 859380, 70270, '<td valign="top">not seeing the connection to the challenge, and something about the processing makes her look a bit unnatural.</td>', 'not seeing the connection to the challenge, and something about the processing makes her look a bit unnatural.', '2010-03-20 10:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911007, 860817, 70270, '<td valign="top">like the high key, but not the composition.  I think a tighter crop to focus the eye on one of the side branches, perhaps the one hanging down in the middle, would have worked better.</td>', 'like the high key, but not the composition.  I think a tighter crop to focus the eye on one of the side branches, perhaps the one hanging down in the middle, would have worked better.', '2010-03-20 10:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911008, 860493, 70270, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see much of a focal point here, and there''s just not that much visual interest to draw me into the image.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see much of a focal point here, and there''s just not that much visual interest to draw me into the image.', '2010-03-20 10:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911013, 860744, 70270, '<td valign="top">looks like an ancient bristlecone.  I think the horizon line running through the pine kills this.  I would have liked to see you get even lower so the sky is more fully behind the tree.  Lighting looks a little flat, or maybe you just took too much contrast out in post processing.  B+W would have been a good choice here.</td>', 'looks like an ancient bristlecone.  I think the horizon line running through the pine kills this.  I would have liked to see you get even lower so the sky is more fully behind the tree.  Lighting looks a little flat, or maybe you just took too much contrast out in post processing.  B+W would have been a good choice here.', '2010-03-20 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911121, 860635, 23317, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge.  I love the mystery created by the shadows and darkness.  10 from me.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge.  I love the mystery created by the shadows and darkness.  10 from me.', '2010-03-20 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911122, 860489, 23317, '<td valign="top">Beautiful saturation and colors.  One of my top 2.</td>', 'Beautiful saturation and colors.  One of my top 2.', '2010-03-20 13:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911227, 860426, 111937, '<td valign="top">Lovely pic ...v nice composition.</td>', 'Lovely pic ...v nice composition.', '2010-03-20 17:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911228, 860679, 111937, '<td valign="top">V nice shot.</td>', 'V nice shot.', '2010-03-20 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911229, 860711, 111937, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic ..I wish leaves were all green</td>', 'Very nice pic ..I wish leaves were all green', '2010-03-20 17:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911230, 859875, 111937, '<td valign="top">nicely caught rainbow</td>', 'nicely caught rainbow', '2010-03-20 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911231, 860534, 111937, '<td valign="top">I find contrast lil bit on higher side...</td>', 'I find contrast lil bit on higher side...', '2010-03-20 17:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911232, 860386, 111937, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more water.</td>', 'Would like to see more water.', '2010-03-20 17:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911289, 859990, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good tribute!!</td>', 'Very good tribute!!', '2010-03-20 18:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911327, 860809, 106543, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge, refreshing to see a non tree picture :)</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge, refreshing to see a non tree picture :)', '2010-03-20 19:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911337, 860208, 37845, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot. The twisted tree looks like a miserly old man. I fully expect to see this on the front page.</td>', 'Stunning shot. The twisted tree looks like a miserly old man. I fully expect to see this on the front page.', '2010-03-20 20:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911338, 859990, 37845, '<td valign="top">Easily the most creative shot in this challenge. I dont really know who Jan von Holleben is, but I think he would be proud of this shot.</td>', 'Easily the most creative shot in this challenge. I dont really know who Jan von Holleben is, but I think he would be proud of this shot.', '2010-03-20 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911340, 860802, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, with all the lines drawing the viewer to the left. I really like the tones in the sky as well.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, with all the lines drawing the viewer to the left. I really like the tones in the sky as well.', '2010-03-20 20:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911341, 860811, 37845, '<td valign="top">If I were a guessing man, I would think this is either <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a>''s shot, or <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=82707" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Brat</a>''s. Either way, its one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'If I were a guessing man, I would think this is either  Judi''s shot, or  Brat''s. Either way, its one of the best in the challenge.', '2010-03-20 20:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911342, 859826, 37845, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and simplistic. I like the selective desaturation, and the shadow in the bg is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful, and simplistic. I like the selective desaturation, and the shadow in the bg is perfect.', '2010-03-20 20:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911343, 860525, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very zen like... beautiful shot.</td>', 'Very zen like... beautiful shot.', '2010-03-20 20:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911352, 860799, 104841, '<td valign="top">wow what whacky branches, great. In my opinion  the light is a little bit too harsh.</td>', 'wow what whacky branches, great. In my opinion  the light is a little bit too harsh.', '2010-03-20 20:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911393, 860721, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of your shot. The floor appears to be slightly lopsided so it appears to be a mistake, either make sure it is straight or shoot it using a bigger angle to show you are doing it on purpose.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of your shot. The floor appears to be slightly lopsided so it appears to be a mistake, either make sure it is straight or shoot it using a bigger angle to show you are doing it on purpose.', '2010-03-20 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911442, 859565, 111937, '<td valign="top">nice pic and composition. Darkening it lil bit might enhance it</td>', 'nice pic and composition. Darkening it lil bit might enhance it', '2010-03-21 00:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911665, 859990, 113900, '<td valign="top">My pick for the blue.  Very well conceived and the execution was perfect.  Excellent job</td>', 'My pick for the blue.  Very well conceived and the execution was perfect.  Excellent job', '2010-03-21 11:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911678, 860817, 115802, '<td valign="top">nice,,,,,,,,,,,</td>', 'nice,,,,,,,,,,,', '2010-03-21 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911739, 860658, 104378, '<td valign="top">bear, lizard, owl, scorpion, monkey, mantis and a little tiny giraffe head</td>', 'bear, lizard, owl, scorpion, monkey, mantis and a little tiny giraffe head', '2010-03-21 13:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911762, 859380, 69102, '<td valign="top">too much shadow highlight - and how, exactly is this a "branch" shot?</td>', 'too much shadow highlight - and how, exactly is this a "branch" shot?', '2010-03-21 14:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911769, 860790, 69102, '<td valign="top">I doubt you will get much love from the general DPC voters, but this is my definitive favorite of the challenge.  Wonderfully composed and realized. (10)</td>', 'I doubt you will get much love from the general DPC voters, but this is my definitive favorite of the challenge.  Wonderfully composed and realized. (10)', '2010-03-21 14:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911771, 860626, 69102, '<td valign="top">Superb colors and mood.  I wish the willow branches stood out a little better agains the background, but near perfect. (9)</td>', 'Superb colors and mood.  I wish the willow branches stood out a little better agains the background, but near perfect. (9)', '2010-03-21 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911772, 860525, 69102, '<td valign="top">lovely tones and great bokeh</td>', 'lovely tones and great bokeh', '2010-03-21 14:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5911790, 860529, 5364, '<td valign="top">While I like the tones and the processing, I really don''t like what I feel to be excessive negative space at the top.</td>', 'While I like the tones and the processing, I really don''t like what I feel to be excessive negative space at the top.', '2010-03-21 15:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
