(5912084, 860651, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally a waterfall person but the light here is lovely and the B&amp;W conversion is to die for.</td>', 'I''m not normally a waterfall person but the light here is lovely and the B&W conversion is to die for.', '2010-03-21 20:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912085, 860208, 30982, '<td valign="top">An instance where your choice of subject is just perfect for the challenge, and you made sure to photograph it well, too!</td>', 'An instance where your choice of subject is just perfect for the challenge, and you made sure to photograph it well, too!', '2010-03-21 20:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912093, 860205, 88850, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  I love it!<br/> <br/>(not voting)<br/> <br/>I wasn''t going to vote but I decided to just so I could give this a 10!</td>', 'Wonderful!  I love it! (not voting) I wasn''t going to vote but I decided to just so I could give this a 10!', '2010-03-21 20:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912098, 860796, 32011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Perfect for the theme.  I love the processing and composition.  One of my top 10 favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Perfect for the theme.  I love the processing and composition.  One of my top 10 favourites for this challenge.', '2010-03-21 21:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912100, 860399, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I love the detail and use of shallow DOF to bring attention to it.  Processing is great... though somewhat unconventional here on DPC... I''m thinking that''s what I like so much about it... has a warmth about it.  I feel I was a bit harsh on this during my voting phase and bumping it up a little to join 8 other images I''ve given my top.  Well done.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  I love the detail and use of shallow DOF to bring attention to it.  Processing is great... though somewhat unconventional here on DPC... I''m thinking that''s what I like so much about it... has a warmth about it.  I feel I was a bit harsh on this during my voting phase and bumping it up a little to join 8 other images I''ve given my top.  Well done.', '2010-03-21 21:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912101, 859826, 32011, '<td valign="top">Technically perfect image.  Wonderful use of selective sat, the shadows in the background are a wonderful touch... details are shark... good border.  Should do very well and I personally reckon this will ribbon.</td>', 'Technically perfect image.  Wonderful use of selective sat, the shadows in the background are a wonderful touch... details are shark... good border.  Should do very well and I personally reckon this will ribbon.', '2010-03-21 21:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912102, 860445, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great breathe of fresh air in this challenge... something COMPLETELY different... something to make the viewer think.  Love the simplicity of this, VERY MUCH.  I hope that you haven''t been punished too harshly for making the voters think a little.</td>', 'Great breathe of fresh air in this challenge... something COMPLETELY different... something to make the viewer think.  Love the simplicity of this, VERY MUCH.  I hope that you haven''t been punished too harshly for making the voters think a little.', '2010-03-21 21:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912157, 860819, 81362, '<td valign="top">This interesting set of windows makes a nice set of frames for the branches. Cropping away the twigs at the bottom (hedge?) could make a cleaner image. In retrospect, stepping to the right a pace or two might have allowed elimination of the diagonal roof line (if the other reflections would permit). 7.</td>', 'This interesting set of windows makes a nice set of frames for the branches. Cropping away the twigs at the bottom (hedge?) could make a cleaner image. In retrospect, stepping to the right a pace or two might have allowed elimination of the diagonal roof line (if the other reflections would permit). 7.', '2010-03-21 21:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912163, 859994, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the branche and the sun rays in the clouds add a good bit of interest. Probably could remove 1/3 to 3/4 of the bottom black area without harm (could make it more panoramic). 7</td>', 'Nice detail in the branche and the sun rays in the clouds add a good bit of interest. Probably could remove 1/3 to 3/4 of the bottom black area without harm (could make it more panoramic). 7', '2010-03-21 21:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912166, 859826, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good use of background shadows as an alternative to stark white high key method. Nice light on the leaves.</td>', 'Good use of background shadows as an alternative to stark white high key method. Nice light on the leaves.', '2010-03-21 22:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912175, 859739, 101117, '<td valign="top">Lacks focus, possibly due to motion blur. The colours tend to blend together as well and the shot is a touch "messy".</td>', 'Lacks focus, possibly due to motion blur. The colours tend to blend together as well and the shot is a touch "messy".', '2010-03-21 22:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912176, 860511, 101117, '<td valign="top">Really nice different shot. What''s odd about it is that I have no idea of the scale of this, it could be a twig or an entire tree!</td>', 'Really nice different shot. What''s odd about it is that I have no idea of the scale of this, it could be a twig or an entire tree!', '2010-03-21 22:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912177, 860387, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting subject and good light too, it''s just a shame you hvae a touch of blur there, possibly motion blur. 6.</td>', 'Nice interesting subject and good light too, it''s just a shame you hvae a touch of blur there, possibly motion blur. 6.', '2010-03-21 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912183, 860807, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition. Let down a little by the fact that the branches seem to be glowing, most likely a result of heavy sharpening or a processing tool. 6.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition. Let down a little by the fact that the branches seem to be glowing, most likely a result of heavy sharpening or a processing tool. 6.', '2010-03-21 22:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912193, 860666, 101117, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really appeal to me, I think it''s the colours against the white background make it feel a bit harsh.</td>', 'This doesn''t really appeal to me, I think it''s the colours against the white background make it feel a bit harsh.', '2010-03-21 22:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912200, 860469, 101117, '<td valign="top">Looks like you took this during a dust storm! It''s an interesting scene, but some of the areas especially along the left are a little dark.</td>', 'Looks like you took this during a dust storm! It''s an interesting scene, but some of the areas especially along the left are a little dark.', '2010-03-21 22:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912202, 860744, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great colours and contrast, a nice striking image overall.</td>', 'Great colours and contrast, a nice striking image overall.', '2010-03-21 22:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912206, 860643, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice details. The black background works well.</td>', 'Nice details. The black background works well.', '2010-03-21 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912209, 860514, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not the most interesting subject, but this one has a certain appeal to me as the light and colours remind me of Scotland (my home country).</td>', 'Not the most interesting subject, but this one has a certain appeal to me as the light and colours remind me of Scotland (my home country).', '2010-03-21 22:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912210, 859826, 63812, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2010-03-21 22:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912211, 860711, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure you could class these as brances, but it''s a nice portrait nontheless. Since you''ve probably been hammered by the DNMC''s already, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and give it an 8.</td>', 'Not entirely sure you could class these as brances, but it''s a nice portrait nontheless. Since you''ve probably been hammered by the DNMC''s already, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and give it an 8.', '2010-03-21 22:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912212, 860534, 101117, '<td valign="top">The processing and angle here give this a bit of an uneasy feeling.</td>', 'The processing and angle here give this a bit of an uneasy feeling.', '2010-03-21 22:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912213, 860454, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed, it does look somewhat magical!</td>', 'Very nice indeed, it does look somewhat magical!', '2010-03-21 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912221, 860635, 101117, '<td valign="top">Love the shadows here, obviously what you were going for but it''s really well done so I had to point it out :)</td>', 'Love the shadows here, obviously what you were going for but it''s really well done so I had to point it out :)', '2010-03-21 22:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912222, 860790, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting title, I was listening to a podcast about "flow" recently, not that it has much to do with your shot but I just thought I would mention it.<br/> <br/>I didn''t instantly like this when I opened it, but it very quickly became appealing, not sure why. I hope people stop and take the time to look at this, it''s a really interesting well done shot.</td>', 'Interesting title, I was listening to a podcast about "flow" recently, not that it has much to do with your shot but I just thought I would mention it. I didn''t instantly like this when I opened it, but it very quickly became appealing, not sure why. I hope people stop and take the time to look at this, it''s a really interesting well done shot.', '2010-03-21 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912225, 860814, 101117, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a touch harsh here, I''m guessing either from an overcast sky or front on flash.</td>', 'Lighting is a touch harsh here, I''m guessing either from an overcast sky or front on flash.', '2010-03-21 22:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912228, 860689, 50695, '<td valign="top">good energy and rhythm</td>', 'good energy and rhythm', '2010-03-21 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912229, 860467, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this piece</td>', 'I like the mood of this piece', '2010-03-21 22:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912230, 860205, 65234, '<td valign="top">Heh ;-)  My puppy likes to carry around a similarly large branch.  Didn''t even think to take a picture of that for this challenge!  This dog looks REALLY happy and the branch makes a great diagonal.  Could use a smidge more room on the top crop if you have it but not a big deal.</td>', 'Heh ;-)  My puppy likes to carry around a similarly large branch.  Didn''t even think to take a picture of that for this challenge!  This dog looks REALLY happy and the branch makes a great diagonal.  Could use a smidge more room on the top crop if you have it but not a big deal.', '2010-03-21 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912233, 860784, 50695, '<td valign="top">gotta love the mealworms</td>', 'gotta love the mealworms', '2010-03-21 22:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912234, 860713, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  These are really nice in a forest where all the other trees are bare.  I have a personal preference for a more diagonal composition but I like the DOF.</td>', 'Pretty.  These are really nice in a forest where all the other trees are bare.  I have a personal preference for a more diagonal composition but I like the DOF.', '2010-03-21 22:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912237, 860804, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Almost a poem.</td>', 'Nicely done. Almost a poem.', '2010-03-21 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912239, 860796, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.</td>', 'Nice tones.', '2010-03-21 22:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912240, 859990, 50695, '<td valign="top">Well executed. If only you could have tilted that basket up a bit.</td>', 'Well executed. If only you could have tilted that basket up a bit.', '2010-03-21 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912241, 860451, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely.</td>', 'lovely.', '2010-03-21 22:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
