(5912244, 860679, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty bits of bokeh in the background.  I think I might actually like this better with a more dramatic crop on the left.</td>', 'Pretty bits of bokeh in the background.  I think I might actually like this better with a more dramatic crop on the left.', '2010-03-21 22:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
