(5912604, 860783, 96530, '<td valign="top">A branch of electricity makes sense to me Carole, but then I worked in a hardware store many years ago and that makes me more familiar with the concept than some others? At any rate, considering this was in a former mental institution I think you did a great job with your treatment here and am sorry more people couldn''t wrap their heads around the idea- it''s a great shot. Your thoughts for a B&amp;W series of this institution sounds like a fine project you should definitely follow through on.</td>', 'A branch of electricity makes sense to me Carole, but then I worked in a hardware store many years ago and that makes me more familiar with the concept than some others? At any rate, considering this was in a former mental institution I think you did a great job with your treatment here and am sorry more people couldn''t wrap their heads around the idea- it''s a great shot. Your thoughts for a B&W series of this institution sounds like a fine project you should definitely follow through on.', '2010-03-22 01:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
