(5912901, 860613, 67152, '<td valign="top">I thought this was lovely.  You seem to have been hit with the same "it''s a good shot but I don''t see how it meets the challenge'' so I will give it a 5 or 6....</td>', 'I thought this was lovely.  You seem to have been hit with the same "it''s a good shot but I don''t see how it meets the challenge'' so I will give it a 5 or 6....', '2010-03-22 07:20:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5912903, 860653, 12796, '<td valign="top">the clouds are washed out and way too overexposed which is why your photo scored little lower here (anyhow scored above me). Since this being an advanced challenge, you could have opted to take multiple exposures to create an HDR thereby retaining cloud details and on leaves. all the best.</td>', 'the clouds are washed out and way too overexposed which is why your photo scored little lower here (anyhow scored above me). Since this being an advanced challenge, you could have opted to take multiple exposures to create an HDR thereby retaining cloud details and on leaves. all the best.', '2010-03-22 07:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5912904, 860773, 113278, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and I say it should of been top 3. Great work and I am posting this over on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.</td>', 'I love this shot and I say it should of been top 3. Great work and I am posting this over on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.', '2010-03-22 07:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5912906, 860790, 113278, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment on this during voting (been a bit busy for that) But, this was one of my favorites. I love the look and feel of this shot and while I thought your work was a different entry I still loved this. Great work and I am posting it on your own thread.</td>', 'I didn''t comment on this during voting (been a bit busy for that) But, this was one of my favorites. I love the look and feel of this shot and while I thought your work was a different entry I still loved this. Great work and I am posting it on your own thread.', '2010-03-22 07:28:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5912908, 860379, 82112, '<td valign="top">This was one of my faves. Would''ve like to seen it MUCH higher. Funny how some of the most interesting effects are accomplished with the simplest means.<br/> <br/>Stan<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-22 10:39:58.</i></td>', 'This was one of my faves. Would''ve like to seen it MUCH higher. Funny how some of the most interesting effects are accomplished with the simplest means. Stan', '2010-03-22 07:30:38.000000', '2010-03-22 10:39:58.000000', 0),
(5912910, 860467, 12796, '<td valign="top">What I really like the most in this image is definitely the vintage mood you have created and you did it very well.<br/>IMO this would have scored high if few pointers had been considered:<br/>1. the photo is way to complex and everything is in focus that voters are unsure on which part of the photo to look for, and the eyes simply keep roaming.<br/>2. usual full tree photos gives a larger impact when shot from a distance and the tree is completely visible, rather than a part of it (unless until it is some beautiful silhouette of a part of a tree)<br/> <br/>All the best.</td>', 'What I really like the most in this image is definitely the vintage mood you have created and you did it very well.IMO this would have scored high if few pointers had been considered:1. the photo is way to complex and everything is in focus that voters are unsure on which part of the photo to look for, and the eyes simply keep roaming.2. usual full tree photos gives a larger impact when shot from a distance and the tree is completely visible, rather than a part of it (unless until it is some beautiful silhouette of a part of a tree) All the best.', '2010-03-22 07:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5912911, 860652, 113278, '<td valign="top">I really liked this shot. Love the colors and the light and the use of the branch to frame the barn. Also your choice to blur the background to focus on the branch. I think this shot was a tad underrated. Posting this onto the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.</td>', 'I really liked this shot. Love the colors and the light and the use of the branch to frame the barn. Also your choice to blur the background to focus on the branch. I think this shot was a tad underrated. Posting this onto the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.', '2010-03-22 07:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5912914, 859990, 38032, '<td valign="top">Inspiring and unexpected.  I like the innocense and casual placement of things.</td>', 'Inspiring and unexpected.  I like the innocense and casual placement of things.', '2010-03-22 07:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
