(5913364, 860809, 24454, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!  That was one of my favorite experiences ever -- hiking to that beautiful waterfall a few months ago.  We knew nothing about it, so were quite surprised to realize we had to practically swim to get there.  But worth every soaked and beat-up-feet second of it.  Thanks for the memory :)</td>', 'How beautiful!  That was one of my favorite experiences ever -- hiking to that beautiful waterfall a few months ago.  We knew nothing about it, so were quite surprised to realize we had to practically swim to get there.  But worth every soaked and beat-up-feet second of it.  Thanks for the memory :)', '2010-03-22 14:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
