(5913673, 859990, 112107, '<td valign="top">Porra João!!! Já não há pachorra pá! :) <br/>Part of this post is in Portuguese because there are children running around...<br/> <br/>I can''t find something to shoot for our private competition and there you go sidetracking Top #10''s one after the other! Pfffff.....<br/> <br/>Just kidding! Congratulations on a great photo, even though I feel the composition is lacking something I can''t really define, the idea was just great and fantastic for the challenge! <br/>Kudos for putting your ideas to practise.</td>', 'Porra João!!! Já não há pachorra pá! :) Part of this post is in Portuguese because there are children running around... I can''t find something to shoot for our private competition and there you go sidetracking Top #10''s one after the other! Pfffff..... Just kidding! Congratulations on a great photo, even though I feel the composition is lacking something I can''t really define, the idea was just great and fantastic for the challenge! Kudos for putting your ideas to practise.', '2010-03-22 18:52:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913679, 860645, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>Absolutely beautiful image.  Well worthy of a ribbon.  Congratulations.  Colours and details here are EXCELLENT... as is the use of shallow DOF.  Well done.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  Absolutely beautiful image.  Well worthy of a ribbon.  Congratulations.  Colours and details here are EXCELLENT... as is the use of shallow DOF.  Well done.', '2010-03-22 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913697, 859875, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>Good capture and composition.  Don''t know if you could have done a little more to make the colour pop a bit more... regardless... is a nice take on the challenge, and a very nice photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  Good capture and composition.  Don''t know if you could have done a little more to make the colour pop a bit more... regardless... is a nice take on the challenge, and a very nice photo.  Well done.', '2010-03-22 19:06:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913702, 860790, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>I really like this... wasn''t in my top scoring group, but was in the bunch JUST below.  As we''ve come to expect from our illustrious leader, this is a wonderful work of art.  Bravo!  I love the mood, the emotion.  Technically, the composition is wonderful...</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  I really like this... wasn''t in my top scoring group, but was in the bunch JUST below.  As we''ve come to expect from our illustrious leader, this is a wonderful work of art.  Bravo!  I love the mood, the emotion.  Technically, the composition is wonderful...', '2010-03-22 19:10:14.000000', NULL, 0),
