(5913805, 860798, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! I''m still trying to figure out how and when the sunbursts happen. When I try to get them, they don''t happen, when I least expect it, there it is! It really enhances and already interesting shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot! I''m still trying to figure out how and when the sunbursts happen. When I try to get them, they don''t happen, when I least expect it, there it is! It really enhances and already interesting shot!', '2010-03-22 20:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913856, 860798, 61651, '<td valign="top">The disorientation is exactly what makes this shot so effective.  Great control of that shaft of light peeking through.</td>', 'The disorientation is exactly what makes this shot so effective.  Great control of that shaft of light peeking through.', '2010-03-22 22:11:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913867, 859990, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really really well done and full of whimsy and delight!</td>', 'Really really well done and full of whimsy and delight!', '2010-03-22 22:18:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913894, 860208, 63244, '<td valign="top">Vlado, way to go!! This snag, snagged a blue for you! Congrats!</td>', 'Vlado, way to go!! This snag, snagged a blue for you! Congrats!', '2010-03-22 22:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913944, 860798, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>Nice detail and tones/contrast... While it''s a "rather literal interpretation" it''s not conventional.  No surprise there though... one of the reasons we love you so.  I find this image a bit unbalanced, personally... it feels top heavy and makes me feel like I''ve had too much to drink and laying on the grass in the park waiting for the world to stop spinning.  :)</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  Nice detail and tones/contrast... While it''s a "rather literal interpretation" it''s not conventional.  No surprise there though... one of the reasons we love you so.  I find this image a bit unbalanced, personally... it feels top heavy and makes me feel like I''ve had too much to drink and laying on the grass in the park waiting for the world to stop spinning.  :)', '2010-03-23 00:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913946, 860208, 30982, '<td valign="top">That tree simply has a wonderful personality.  Congrats on the ribbon for this one!  Be sure you let your model know.</td>', 'That tree simply has a wonderful personality.  Congrats on the ribbon for this one!  Be sure you let your model know.', '2010-03-23 00:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913957, 860635, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>What a great image.  Don''t feel I gave this enough of a chance when voting... looking at it now, I''m seeing a lot that I don''t remember seeing before.  Powerful.  Beautiful.  I can only apologise for not giving it the time, and score it deserves... i.e. should have been up there with my other favourites.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  What a great image.  Don''t feel I gave this enough of a chance when voting... looking at it now, I''m seeing a lot that I don''t remember seeing before.  Powerful.  Beautiful.  I can only apologise for not giving it the time, and score it deserves... i.e. should have been up there with my other favourites.', '2010-03-23 00:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913958, 860469, 69325, '<td valign="top">you know you''re becoming a ribbon heavyweight when you don''t even add comments to the shot ;)<br/> <br/>congrats</td>', 'you know you''re becoming a ribbon heavyweight when you don''t even add comments to the shot ;) congrats', '2010-03-23 00:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913960, 860462, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>Like Melethia''s image, this makes me feel like I''m on my back in the park, but unlike hers, it doesn''t feel unbalanced and thus, doesn''t make me feel like I''m on the ground because I''m drunk.  :)<br/></td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  Like Melethia''s image, this makes me feel like I''m on my back in the park, but unlike hers, it doesn''t feel unbalanced and thus, doesn''t make me feel like I''m on the ground because I''m drunk.  :)', '2010-03-23 00:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913962, 860452, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>I think the last four commenters have said it all, and said it well.  "Cluttered" and "undramatic".  A different angle, or a different approach could have worked, or if you''d included a point of interest to compliment the branch... a person or animal.  it''s not a bad image, not by any definition, it''s just not interesting enough, especially for the DPC crowd.  They''re tough!</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  I think the last four commenters have said it all, and said it well.  "Cluttered" and "undramatic".  A different angle, or a different approach could have worked, or if you''d included a point of interest to compliment the branch... a person or animal.  it''s not a bad image, not by any definition, it''s just not interesting enough, especially for the DPC crowd.  They''re tough!', '2010-03-23 00:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913964, 860698, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>Sorry Peter, but all that comes to me is "I don''t get it"... and it''s not like others that I didn''t get in that they still sparked some interest... I wanted to get them, they kept me looking, intrigued, that the photographer saw something that I didn''t... they had something there to hook me... whereas this lacks that hook.  Sorry to be so harsh.  Just my opinion and worth about as much as you''ve paid me for it.  :)</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  Sorry Peter, but all that comes to me is "I don''t get it"... and it''s not like others that I didn''t get in that they still sparked some interest... I wanted to get them, they kept me looking, intrigued, that the photographer saw something that I didn''t... they had something there to hook me... whereas this lacks that hook.  Sorry to be so harsh.  Just my opinion and worth about as much as you''ve paid me for it.  :)', '2010-03-23 00:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913969, 860603, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>Love the border... think I might use something like that on my photos  ;)<br/> <br/>Wonderful colour and detail, and I like the wallpaper pattern feel of the composition.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  Love the border... think I might use something like that on my photos  ;) Wonderful colour and detail, and I like the wallpaper pattern feel of the composition.', '2010-03-23 01:06:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913971, 860644, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>I have to say that I cannot even begin to comprehend how this image didn''t finish MUCH higher.  Great colour, composition, detail, use of shallow DOF (I love the bokeh) ... all excellent.  Perhaps a tad soft at the end of the branch, but no way deserving of the punishment it got from voters.  I think your title describes your treatment from the voters... "Ouch" indeed.  :(</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  I have to say that I cannot even begin to comprehend how this image didn''t finish MUCH higher.  Great colour, composition, detail, use of shallow DOF (I love the bokeh) ... all excellent.  Perhaps a tad soft at the end of the branch, but no way deserving of the punishment it got from voters.  I think your title describes your treatment from the voters... "Ouch" indeed.  :(', '2010-03-23 01:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5913974, 860666, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... .<br/> <br/>Yet another Team Suck member, treated too harshly by the voters, I feel.  That said, I''ve found that my simple, minimalist images are very hit and miss, more miss than hit actually.  I like the colour and the detail.  Shallow DOF is a bit distracting though (IMHO).  Composition works well for me.  Think the voters were a bit harsh in this instance.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... . Yet another Team Suck member, treated too harshly by the voters, I feel.  That said, I''ve found that my simple, minimalist images are very hit and miss, more miss than hit actually.  I like the colour and the detail.  Shallow DOF is a bit distracting though (IMHO).  Composition works well for me.  Think the voters were a bit harsh in this instance.', '2010-03-23 01:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5914115, 859990, 114930, '<td valign="top">Bem me parecia que ia sair uma optima qualificação...</td>', 'Bem me parecia que ia sair uma optima qualificação...', '2010-03-23 07:50:29.000000', NULL, 0),
