(5914176, 859826, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh dang.   THIS is gorgeous.   *sigh*  (not voting)<br/> <br/>*grin*  Congrats on your ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I repeat my comment from voting.  :D<br/> <br/>Congrats again!   This is stunning.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Oh dang.   THIS is gorgeous.   *sigh*  (not voting) *grin*  Congrats on your ribbon!   I repeat my comment from voting.  :D Congrats again!   This is stunning.', '2010-03-23 09:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
