(5914320, 860452, 113278, '<td valign="top">Wow that is one big tree. Not sure I can really add to what these great minds have already said, just keep on shooting, love to see what''s next from you.</td>', 'Wow that is one big tree. Not sure I can really add to what these great minds have already said, just keep on shooting, love to see what''s next from you.', '2010-03-23 11:25:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5914325, 860698, 113278, '<td valign="top">I didn''t really care for this too much, perhaps I didn''t explore the image enough and if I spend more time with it it may grow on me. But that is the beauty of Art, so many different views and takes and I do enjoy seeing the creative minds at work and the different interpetations of the challenges. So while I didn''t particularly care for this entry I do appreciate this kind of entry.</td>', 'I didn''t really care for this too much, perhaps I didn''t explore the image enough and if I spend more time with it it may grow on me. But that is the beauty of Art, so many different views and takes and I do enjoy seeing the creative minds at work and the different interpetations of the challenges. So while I didn''t particularly care for this entry I do appreciate this kind of entry.', '2010-03-23 11:27:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5914330, 860603, 113278, '<td valign="top">The blue color on this is excellent and I love the overabundance of branches. Also really liked the crop and border you went with.</td>', 'The blue color on this is excellent and I love the overabundance of branches. Also really liked the crop and border you went with.', '2010-03-23 11:28:39.000000', NULL, 0),
