(5914336, 860208, 113278, '<td valign="top">Well I didn''t give you a 10 but I did give it a 9 :) Not real sure what I knocked off a point for but you were in my top 5. Love the color and deep depth of field and excellent crop and border, Well done and congrats.</td>', 'Well I didn''t give you a 10 but I did give it a 9 :) Not real sure what I knocked off a point for but you were in my top 5. Love the color and deep depth of field and excellent crop and border, Well done and congrats.', '2010-03-23 11:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
