(5928854, 860783, 67697, '<td valign="top">I saw the connection, and I thought it was a great idea!  Loved the black and white too.  My only quibble was that I felt you should have aligned it so that the box and pipe were straight up and were parallel to the side of the frame.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'I saw the connection, and I thought it was a great idea!  Loved the black and white too.  My only quibble was that I felt you should have aligned it so that the box and pipe were straight up and were parallel to the side of the frame.  Keep up the good work!', '2010-04-03 14:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
