(6955835, 860790, 5112, '<td valign="top">More so than flow, this, to me, feels trapped.  Almost the opposite to flow.  It feels to me like nothing is getting anywhere, but it is all trapped in little circles.  I do like the wild diagonals, and I also very much like how it is such a common scene, so everyday (well, everyday on rainy days, when the trees are bare).  I love common scenes!</td>', 'More so than flow, this, to me, feels trapped.  Almost the opposite to flow.  It feels to me like nothing is getting anywhere, but it is all trapped in little circles.  I do like the wild diagonals, and I also very much like how it is such a common scene, so everyday (well, everyday on rainy days, when the trees are bare).  I love common scenes!', '2013-01-12 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
